                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A very interesting Visual Novel. The story was deep and compelling, I enjoyed it a lot.\r\nIt has some bugs that prevents getting certain steam achievements, but they can still be unlocked, it's no big deal.\r\n\r\nBUT. There is one thing that really bothered me:\r\nAs much as I enjoyed the story, I personally think the endings are too similar. But maybe it feels that way because when trying to hunt achivements I kept replaying endings that at some point it felt like it's basically the same.\r\nIn general getting the achievements felt incredibly tiresome. I really liked to game but a part of me is glad I am done with this game",
